</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.6.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle" style="padding-top:4.65pt;padding-bottom:4.65pt;">
<span id="S2.T1.6.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:184.9pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;">
