<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">LLM learns when to think, adaptively select between short-form and long-form reasoning, Decoupled GRPO (DeGRPO), RL, control token (</span><math id="S3.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;short&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;short&gt;</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><math id="S3.T5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;think&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">&lt;</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;" mathbackground="#EAF8FD" mathsize="0.900em">&gt;</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;think&gt;</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">) and response token</span></span>
</span></td>
