</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.6.1.10.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:4.65pt;padding-bottom:4.65pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:108.1pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;">
<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Mathematical reasoning</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:4.65pt;padding-bottom:4.65pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:213.4pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;">
<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">AIME24 </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib104" title="" class="ltx_ref">MathAI, 2024a</a><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
Minerva Algebra (MATH </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib57" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hendrycks et al., 2021b</a><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">),
MATH-500 </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib88" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lightman et al., 2024</a><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">,
GSM8K </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib26" title="" class="ltx_ref">Cobbe et al., 2021</a><span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.5.1.1.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T5.6.1.10.6" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_bb" style="padding-top:4.65pt;padding-bottom:4.65pt;">
<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.6.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:45.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;">
<span id="S3.T5.6.1.10.6.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><a href="https://github.com/VainF/Thinkless" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:90%;">GitHub</a></span>
</span></td></tr>
