</span></td>
<td id="S5.T11.6.1.2.7" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:4.65pt;padding-bottom:4.65pt;">
<span id="S5.T11.6.1.2.7.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:85.4pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EAF8FD;">
<span id="S5.T11.6.1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><a href="https://huggingface.co/datasets/Xkev/llava-cot-100k" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:90%;">HuggingFace</a><span id="S5.T11.6.1.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, </span><a href="https://github.com/PKU-YuanGroup/LLaVA-CoT" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="font-size:90%;">GitHub</a></span>
</span></td></tr>
